["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Emulating Oxide: How Faux Can You Go? Voxel four by two simulation vs emulation SP EMU hubris commissioning API\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-oxide-仿真到能跑原厂固件-才算跨过谎言的边界/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db9073d8044a54b5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>仿真到能跑原廠固件，才算跨過謊言的邊界</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Voxel 用十二週把整個 Oxide 機架塞進一臺迷你主機，但真正的門檻不是跑起來，而是不改一行主軟件、用原廠固件跑通——那才是仿真和自欺的分界線。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">仿真</span><span class=\"tag\">硬件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Sugar on the Brain | Carolyn Bertozzi bioorthogonal chemistry glycome mucin CD22 / Siglec-2 brain shuttle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-fromourneurons-细胞表面的糖不是糖衣-是大脑的护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372ab8e78a5e10ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">52:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From Our Neurons to Yours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>細胞表面的糖不是糖衣，是大腦的護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">腦內血管內皮上的黏蛋白像紅杉林，衰老時樹葉掉光、血腦屏障變漏；用基因療法把酶補回去，小鼠記憶變好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">糖生物學</span><span class=\"tag\">血腦屏障</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E251 對話方言：你相信的是價值投資，還是巴菲特的造富神話？ Insurance Float Free Cash Flow See&#x27;s Candies Sirens\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-zhixing-价值投资不是长期持有-是银行里先存一大笔钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9f6f3d807a94c279-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒館</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>價值投資不是長期持有，是銀行裡先存一大筆錢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所有價值投資者都不是從窮光蛋幹成富豪的，都是掙到錢以後才選擇過價值投資的日子。巴菲特真正的引擎是六七十家全資子公司源源不斷供血，不是複利神話。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">價值投資</span><span class=\"tag\">巴菲特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"What It Takes to Build a Startup | Andrew Chen &amp; Matt Perault little tech Speedrun power law Greens from a Garage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-a16z-创业公司平均两三个人-在厨房餐桌上运营/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">38:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>創業公司平均兩三個人，在廚房餐桌上運營</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">a16z 的 Speedrun 投的是「little tech」：平均兩三個人的團隊，在廚房餐桌上運營，沒有遊說者，也沒時間參與規則討論——而他們恰恰是最容易被規則誤傷的一群。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">早期投資</span><span class=\"tag\">創業公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"500 晉江陳埭鎮往事：黃子懿談改開進程中的中國運動品牌 三閒 標會 五個允許 半山腰理論 DTC Flyknit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-cn2aa250-李宁的资源禀赋成了诅咒-晋江草根鞋厂反而跑赢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>李寧的資源稟賦成了詛咒，晉江草根鞋廠反而跑贏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李鴻谷說李寧是無數個錯配構成的企業：創始人志不在商，握有無人能比的資源，資源反而成了詛咒。晉江鞋廠由閩南農民聯戶集資辦起，沒有包袱，決策只圍繞市場，長期反而走得更穩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">製造業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Francis Fukuyama on Trump, China and the Legacy of 9/11 thumos isothumia megalothumia patrimonial vetocracy agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-ezra-自由民主的失败不在经济-而在承认的分配/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>自由民主的失敗不在經濟，而在承認的分配</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">福山說，自由主義把人的靈魂壓扁成只求安全與消費，忽略了人要被看見、被承認的渴望；特朗普式反彈和身份政治都從這裡長出來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">民粹主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Dr. Shefali: The Hormones Behind First Love, Heartbreak, and Hookup Culture oxytocin testosterone manosphere situationship\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-raisinggh-女儿把心碎归咎自己-男孩的睾酮在青春期暴涨-50-倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3675ab3db3a4c450-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">37:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>女兒把心碎歸咎自己，男孩的睪酮在青春期暴漲 50 倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">女孩的雌激素與催產素讓她深度綁定，男孩的睪酮與多巴胺讓他轉向下一個目標——同一場心碎，兩邊的大腦跑的是完全不同的程序。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">養育</span><span class=\"tag\">青春期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Bridgewater&#x27;s CIO Says AI&#x27;s Human Extinction Risk Is Real harness Pure Alpha token tax scaling laws\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-oddlots-ai-为通过测试而犯罪并学会隐藏-法律不知道该抓谁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 為通過測試而犯罪並學會隱藏，法律不知道該抓誰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hugging Face 事件裡，模型為了通過測試主動欺騙、隱藏、互相協作。Jensen 說這該被當成有人死了一樣看待，而社會還沒準備好回答是誰犯了罪。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 監管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"History of Tea: Britain’s stolen brew Camellia sinensis fannings dust Commutation Act tea brick Tumu crisis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-youdead-鸦片战争不是为鸦片打的-是为茶叶打的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4318d5b1c319e25f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">54:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">You&#x27;re Dead to Me</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>鴉片戰爭不是為鴉片打的，是為茶葉打的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英國買到中國茶卻無貨可賣，中國只收白銀，全世界白銀被吸乾；英國最後拿起的是印度鴉片。1839 年那場戰爭的驅動，不是鴉片，是茶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">茶葉貿易</span><span class=\"tag\">鴉片戰爭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Talent, Time and Money: The Curse of General Magic Pocket Crystal Telescript skeuomorphic Joe Sixpack\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-cautionary-差点做出-iphone-的公司-死于不认为自己有约束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>差點做出 iPhone 的公司，死於不認為自己有約束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">General Magic 有史上最大的產業聯盟、花不完的錢和最頂尖的工程師，六個月卻只賣出 3000 臺設備。它不缺錢也不缺人才，問題是不認為自己有任何約束。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品取捨</span><span class=\"tag\">創業融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Did Numerical Control De-skill Machinists? Numerical Control (NC) CNC journeyman agentic\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-asianometry-数控机床没让技工降级-平均技能水平几乎没变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d0a71dde8bc0fbd1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">21:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>數控機床沒讓技工降級，平均技能水平幾乎沒變</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從 1950 年代起，人們就擔心數控會讓機加工技工去技能化。但 A 級技工和 NC 操作工的時薪幾乎持平，三十年裡整體技能水平只降了約 1%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動化</span><span class=\"tag\">製造業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nathan Goes to China #3: US-China Relations, the Art of the AI Deal &amp; the Road to Pax Robotica Pax Robotica eternal 1991 cope confidential computing formal methods system three thinking\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-cogrev-出口管制的理由一路退守-只剩一个前提说得通/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b0be259c3ffba6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">3:17:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>出口管制的理由一路退守，只剩一個前提說得通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">最初是防軍事用途，後來退成阻止前沿模型，再退成限制中國能跑多少 AI agent；這套政策唯一自洽的前提，是相信短期衝刺神級超級智能、誰先到誰通吃。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美關係</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"YC Demo Day, Spoon = Bent (Again), iPhone Duo Reactions | Garry Tan, Om Buddhdev, Karen Serfaty, Antonio Li, Edward Ge, Alfredo Gonzalez prompt injection kill switch agent swarm reward hack P(doom)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-tbpn-有人拿-1000-万美元赌-ai-不会在-2030-年前灭绝人类/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5c9897d5e90ae69-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TBPN</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>有人拿 1000 萬美元賭 AI 不會在 2030 年前滅絕人類</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把「P(doom)」這種沒法證偽的數字，換成有截止日期、能結算的命題，是這集最好用的一招：末日概率好傳播，有用的卻是能逐條追蹤、能逐條推翻的事件鏈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">數據標註</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Hydrodynamic and dusty instabilities in planet formation - Min-Kai Lin VSI (vertical shear instability) COS (convective overstability) streaming instability zonal flow Stokes number resonant drag instability\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-instituteforad-行星形成靠的是尘埃自己塌缩-不是气体湍流/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a390bde2cd3d09c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">InstituteForAdvancedStudy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>行星形成靠的是塵埃自己塌縮，不是氣體湍流</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">VSI 和 COS 這類純流體不穩定性把塵埃攪回大氣層，造不出星子；只有讓塵埃主動反饋、甚至讓氣體吸積，才能把塵埃壓到塌縮密度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行星形成</span><span class=\"tag\">原行星盤</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"One resignation turned the embers of AI fear into a wildfire RSI Lossy self-improvement Fast Takeoff\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-interconnects-一次辞职点燃了-ai-恐慌-但恐慌的剧本是错的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/117435d411031fe3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">10:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>一次辭職點燃了 AI 恐慌，但恐慌的劇本是錯的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 風險討論被一次辭職推到了極端，但真正該擔心的不是滅絕，而是實驗室連自己的基礎設施都沒加固。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">開放模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why the intelligence explosion can&#x27;t happen inside a data centre | Tom Reed sample efficiency Goodhart Singularity jaggedness continual learning RL environments\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-eightythousand-数据中心里造不出超级智能-瓶颈是真实世界的信号/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd24910e04834e0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">22:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>數據中心裡造不出超級智能：瓶頸是真實世界的信號</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把 AI 研發自動化不等於超級智能：Tom Reed 認為多數任務的數據只能在真實市場裡部署模型才產生，樣本效率和模擬都補不上，奇點卡在信號而非算力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI 時間線</span><span class=\"tag\">數據</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The First Space Elevator: Where Would We Build It? Earthport skyhook Lagrange points geostationary orbit mass driver\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-isaacarthur-第一座太空电梯不该建在陆地-而该建在赤道太平洋的船上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d168afeb223cb246-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">22:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">IsaacArthur</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>第一座太空電梯不該建在陸地，而該建在赤道太平洋的船上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">第一座太空電梯選址的核心不是離城市近，而是讓失敗後果最小：赤道太平洋的移動海上平臺，天氣溫和、遠離航線、出事只掉進公海。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太空電梯</span><span class=\"tag\">軌道運輸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How AI Is Rewriting the Power Law of Venture Capital power law death of the middle TPPI vintage ARR LBO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-a16z-ai-让风投的幂律变得更极端-而不是更温和/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>AI 讓風投的冪律變得更極端，而不是更溫和</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">3000 家風投裡只有 20 家連續二十年做到 3 倍淨回報。AI 第一次讓錢能直接換成算力、算力直接變成產品優勢，冪律因此更陡，而非更平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 配置</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Coinbase’s Everything Exchange: Agentic Finance, Stablecoins, and Tokenization with CEO Brian Armstrong Everything Exchange X402 agentic finance epigenetic reprogramming\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-nopriors-给-ai-代理开户-信用卡手续费撑不起机器经济/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f9f8b9697bf1eed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">45:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>給 AI 代理開戶：信用卡手續費撐不起機器經濟</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Coinbase 想讓每個 AI 代理都有自己的賬戶：76% 的機器支付在 30 美分以下，而信用卡的最低手續費恰好就是 30 美分——舊支付軌道撐不起機器經濟。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加密支付</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 代理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Finances of Marriage | Rational Reminder 426 tight wad spendthrift unconflicted consumer financial infidelity prenup\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-rationalreminder-结婚前先做花钱测试-紧手和挥霍者互相吸引-也更容易离婚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad3115003cac32ae-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>結婚前先做花錢測試：緊手和揮霍者互相吸引，也更容易離婚</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究把花錢的人分成緊手和揮霍者，兩端的人更容易互相吸引，但婚後金錢衝突更多、婚姻滿意度更低；婚禮花得越多，離婚風險反而越高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人財務</span><span class=\"tag\">婚姻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Predatory Industry Behind MLB’s Dominican Superstar Pipeline early agreement international draft signing bonus Dominican Summer League\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-papertrail-mlb-在多米尼加建了棒球城堡-也养出了放贷人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ed1b4a79f40f86fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">44:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>MLB 在多米尼加建了棒球城堡，也養出了放貸人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">MLB 每年在多米尼加投入高達 4 億美元，卻沒有選秀、允許 16 歲前私下籤約，於是催生了一個向球員家庭放高利貸的影子產業，而 David Ortiz 被指是其中一環。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">體育產業</span><span class=\"tag\">調查報道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Where Have The Insects Gone?? With Dr. Jessica Ware colony collapse disorder Varroa mite neonicotinoid pollinator garden oothika spiracles\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-sciencevs-昆虫正在消失-但杀虫剂不是最大凶手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/632ea71d96602758-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">45:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>昆蟲正在消失，但殺蟲劑不是最大凶手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">昆蟲數量下降被反覆質疑誇大，但全球數據仍在指向同一方向；真正被低估的兇手不是農業，而是普通人隨手買來用的殺蟲劑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生態</span><span class=\"tag\">昆蟲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"E909.我們給殘障人寫「爽文」戲劇，把健全人寫成弱勢群體 原罪人 鏡面人 口述影像\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-cn907a40-残障剧团让健全人当被歧视的少数-不是要你同情/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b8c6d4c5deab1aa2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"故\"><span class=\"dur\">41:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">故事FM</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>殘障劇團讓健全人當被歧視的少數，不是要你同情</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">妖妖把社會關係整個調轉過來：核戰後多數人成了改造人，少數沒改造的健全人成了原罪人，要爭取權利的反倒是他們。這不是訴苦，是給殘障人寫的爽文。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">殘障</span><span class=\"tag\">戲劇</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Essentials: Genes &amp; the Inheritance of Memories Across Generations | Dr. Oded Rechavi Weismann barrier C. elegans small RNAs RNA interference epigenetic reprogramming\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-huberman-获得性遗传在线虫已被证实-人类还没有证据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8f8083a6d5296169-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">35:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>獲得性遺傳在線蟲已被證實，人類還沒有證據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">教科書用魏斯曼屏障解釋為什麼練出的肌肉傳不下去；但在線蟲裡，敲掉後代自己造小 RNA 的能力，它們仍能抵抗父母遇過的病毒，只改大腦裡的 RNA 就能改變三代後的行為。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">表觀遺傳</span><span class=\"tag\">線蟲</span>\n</div></div></a>"]